      "role": "user",
      "content": "we checked the thermostat and it seems to be reading fine on the digital display. we even used an external thermal gun to verify and the heat is even across the whole platen. its not the room temp either, the AC is constant. it's just so random. one minute it's perfect and the next it's like the color just... vanished during the press. is there any chance it's a gas or chemical issue with the ink evaporating too fast?",
