      "content": "It is less likely to be a gas issue unless there are significant fumes or contamination in your venting system. A more probable cause for sudden inconsistency could be an issue with the heat press's internal pressure regulator cycling erratically. Try running a test batch with different sublimation paper to see if the issue persists across various consumables.",
